  keywords: ['solar panel wattage calculator', 'solar panel output calculator', 'solar panel amps calculator', 'solar array size calculator', 'how many watts of solar do i need'],
  formulaPill: 'Array W = Daily Wh ÷ (Sun Hours × Efficiency)',
  lead: 'Use this <strong>solar panel wattage calculator</strong> to turn your daily energy consumption into the total array wattage you actually need. It combines peak sun hours and real system-efficiency losses so the result reflects what your panels deliver on a roof or ground mount — not the optimistic lab rating.',
