  featureList: ['Total solar array wattage from daily Wh', 'Peak-sun-hours and efficiency aware', 'Converts to kW and number of 400W panels', 'Works for RV, cabin, tiny house, and grid-tie'],
  methodology: 'The calculator divides your daily energy requirement in watt-hours by the product of peak sun hours and system efficiency to return the required array wattage. System efficiency (default 75%) bundles inverter conversion, temperature derating, wiring resistance, soiling, and charge-controller losses per NREL PVWatts derate conventions.',
